      "findingClosed": "The old unconditional equivalence between ethoxy shortening and surfactant primary degradation exceeded the supplied data. Eight DE/EN leaf changes correctly require evidence for loss of surface activity. The synthetic 90% parent-removal /10% CO2 record supplies no such assay. Parent removal, biological structural transformation, sorption and mineralisation remain distinct.",
